# C8 product complex: PLAIN (unconstrained) relaxation of the product-side IRC end.
#
# pc_bridge/ was exactly this: a full-system relaxation of the IRC backward
# endpoint, no constraints, no active region. It hit MaxIter 400 while still
# descending -- 0.9 Eh below the IRC endpoint, the proton relayed off O133 onto
# a water. That is a real descent, not a runaway: nothing is wrong with relaxing
# the product end, it just needs more than 400 cycles. This continues from
# pc_bridge's last geometry with a much higher cap and periodic Hessian refresh.
#
# Seed: ../pc_bridge/job.xyz.
# Full system, 21-atom QM1, TightOpt -- same standard as the bridge TS.
! QM/XTB B97-3c ddCOSMO(Water) Opt Freq TightOpt TightSCF

%QMMM
QMATOMS
	{55 58 61 64 120 121 122 123 124 125 126 127 128 129 130 131 132 133 134 135 136}
END
Charge_total 0
Mult_total 1
AutoFF_QM2_Method GFNFF
END

%geom
  MaxIter 2000
  Calc_Hess true
  Recalc_Hess 50
end

%output jsonpropfile true end

%maxcore 4000

%pal
   nprocs 8
end

* xyzfile 0 1 job.xyz
